            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely Devine!! I did not have any sweet onions, I used a finely chopped yellow onion and it still turned out very nice :)\n\nI made it for a party, and there were a few left over. I ate them the day after cold - nice :)\n\nThanks!"
          },
