            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Valerie Brunmeier"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I had high hopes for this but we were disappointed in the end. They look pretty but the taste is just not quite there. The flavor of the soup was too prevalent. I also think they need something to thicken them a bit to improve the texture. As it was they were a bit too \"soupy\" all the way around for our taste.",
            "datePublished": "2011-07-09T18:14:34.680Z"
          },
          {
