            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joy Turner-Price"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Even though these are always the first things to disappear on the buffet these tarts are too good and to easy to save for company. Wonderful in the extreme. Close your eyes and savor the flavor. Yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2010-06-20T14:36:38.680Z"
